cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its synthetic examples, please cite this version."
title: "Organoid Hook Model: a no-wash secondary-conjugate assay simulator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Damko
    given-names: Ermelinda
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dataRichinsightPoor/organoid-hook-model"
url: "https://datarichinsightpoor.github.io/organoid-hook-model/"
abstract: >-
  An uncalibrated finite-volume reaction-transport model and browser atlas
  for generic no-wash secondary-conjugate assays in tumor-organoid-like
  geometry. Separates assembly, trafficking, receptor turnover, productive
  delivery, recoverable damage, and observation models. All outputs and
  defaults are synthetic and illustrative, not experimental estimates.
keywords:
  - organoids
  - hook effect
  - receptor trafficking
  - assay interpretation
  - mathematical modeling
